version: 0.1.0
abstract: "MORPH-DA is a benchmark and verifier for LLM data-analysis agents. It uses metamorphic testing and mutation testing to detect wrong filters, aggregations and time periods in agent-written analysis code without a numeric gold answer or an additional model call."
